["A03","Use case: product-mockup. Asset type: Mock material effect rendering for garment prototype. Square catalog effect rendering of a plain blue-and-white woven shirt label with an abstract simple woven blue stripe pattern and visible woven texture, a single rectangular label with clean edges. It must be a woven brand-style label, not laundry care symbol label. No invented company names, no text, no care symbols, no watermark. White neutral backdrop, soft studio lighting."]
